# P18-V01 PullMessageRequestHeader field surface and P18-V02 current-revision gate — 2026-10-17T15:39:27Z

- Repository: `/Users/bruce.tsai/Projects/trio/rocketmq-classic`.
- Branch: `phase/19-phase-18-compatibility-release-gate`.
- Java oracle: RocketMQ client 5.5.1 commit
  `efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`; inspected read-only.
- Removed Rust-only `PullMessageRequestHeader::lite_topic`, which is absent
  from the pinned Java header. Encoding no longer writes `liteTopic`; decoding
  ignores it as an unknown field. Added
  `pull_request_header_does_not_export_java_absent_lite_topic_field` and
  updated the header validation inventory. Code commit: `86e7cb34`.

